Looking at the SHACL violations:

1. **`archind:pet_mad_xl_pet_model_variant`** is used as object of `train:trainsModelVariant` but is not declared as `arch:ModelVariant` — needs to be added or the object needs to be changed to the existing `archind:pet_mad_xl_variant`.

2. **`trind:pet_mad_lora_finetuning`** uses `train:usesDataset` but is typed as `train:MachineLearningFinetuningRun` — needs `train:MachineLearningTrainingRun` as well (or instead, since the constraint requires it).

3. **`trind:pet_mad_pretraining`** uses `train:usesDataset` but is typed as `train:PretrainingRun` — needs `train:MachineLearningTrainingRun` as well.

4. **`archind:pet_mad_xl_variant`** is `arch:ModelVariant` but has no `arch:hasMachineLearningArchitecture` — needs to link to a `MachineLearningArchitecture`.

```turtle
@prefix arch: <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#> .
@prefix archind: <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#> .
@prefix data: <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/datasetonto#> .
@prefix dataind: <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/dataset-individuals#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix train: <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto#> .
@prefix trind: <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto-individuals#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

archind:pet_family a owl:NamedIndividual,
        arch:ModelFamily ;
    rdfs:label "PET"^^xsd:string ;
    arch:hasVariant archind:pet_mad_xl_variant .

trind:pet_mad_lora_finetuning a owl:NamedIndividual,
        train:MachineLearningFinetuningRun,
        train:MachineLearningTrainingRun ;
    rdfs:label "pet_mad_lora_finetuning"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Fine-tuning of pre-trained PET-MAD using Low-Rank Adaptation (LoRA) with rank 8 and scaling parameter 0.5 on system-specific datasets for six case studies: lithium thiophosphate, gallium arsenide, high-entropy alloy CoCrFeMnNi, liquid water, succinic acid, and barium titanate"^^xsd:string ;
    train:trainsModelVariant archind:pet_mad_xl_variant ;
    train:usesDataset dataind:batio3,
        dataind:gaas,
        dataind:hea25s,
        dataind:lps,
        dataind:succinic_acid,
        dataind:water .

trind:pet_mad_pretraining a owl:NamedIndividual,
        train:PretrainingRun,
        train:MachineLearningTrainingRun ;
    rdfs:label "pet_mad_pretraining"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Pretraining of PET-MAD on the MAD dataset (95,595 structures) using the PET graph neural network architecture with 2.8M parameters, trained for 1500 epochs with Adam optimizer and RMSE loss"^^xsd:string ;
    train:trainsModelVariant archind:pet_mad_xl_variant ;
    train:usesDataset dataind:mad ;
    train:usesLoss trind:root_mean_square_error ;
    train:usesOptimizer trind:adam .

archind:pet_mad_xl_variant a owl:NamedIndividual,
        arch:ModelVariant ;
    rdfs:label "pet_mad_xl"^^xsd:string ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-65662-7.pdf> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom "C:\\Users\\user\\Desktop\\Matbench-onto\\model_yamls\\pet_oam_xl_1_0_0.yml" ;
    arch:hasParameterNumber 730000000 ;
    arch:hasMachineLearningArchitecture archind:pet_architecture .

archind:pet_architecture a owl:NamedIndividual,
        arch:MachineLearningArchitecture,
        arch:GraphNeuralNetworkArchitecture ;
    rdfs:label "PET"^^xsd:string ;
    arch:hasParameterNumber 2800000 .

dataind:batio3 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        data:Dataset ;
    rdfs:label "BaTiO3"^^xsd:string .

dataind:gaas a owl:NamedIndividual,
        data:Dataset ;
    rdfs:label "GaAs"^^xsd:string .

dataind:hea25s a owl:NamedIndividual,
        data:Dataset ;
    rdfs:label "HEA25S"^^xsd:string .

dataind:lps a owl:NamedIndividual,
        data:Dataset ;
    rdfs:label "LPS"^^xsd:string .

dataind:mad a owl:NamedIndividual,
        data:Dataset ;
    rdfs:label "MAD"^^xsd:string .

dataind:succinic_acid a owl:NamedIndividual,
        data:Dataset ;
    rdfs:label "Succinic acid"^^xsd:string .

dataind:water a owl:NamedIndividual,
        data:Dataset ;
    rdfs:label "Water"^^xsd:string .

trind:adam a owl:NamedIndividual,
        train:Optimizer ;
    rdfs:label "Adam"^^xsd:string .

trind:root_mean_square_error a owl:NamedIndividual,
        train:LossFunction ;
    rdfs:label "root-mean-square error"^^xsd:string .